3. In the submit listener, send the trimmed text: `loadShows(searchInput.value.trim());`
4. In `state`, start with no shows: `shows: []`. The page doesn't need data.js any more.
5. Delete the old Start section (the comment and `render();`), and fill in **TODO 2** at the very bottom: `loadShows("");`
